# CVEs that are will_not_fix or fix_deferred in the base image distro —
# no upstream patch exists and the base image maintainer has marked them as
# won't fix. The intentionally vulnerable CVEs in requirements.txt (Flask,
# Werkzeug, Jinja2) are NOT ignored — they're the ones the CI gate is
# designed to catch.

# zlib1g — integer overflow in zipOpenNewFileInZip4_6 (will_not_fix in Debian)
CVE-2023-45853

# libsqlite3-0 — integer overflow (affected, no fix available)
CVE-2025-7458

# perl-base CVEs (CVE-2026-8376, CVE-2026-13221, CVE-2026-42496) are not listed
# here because perl-base is removed from the image in the Dockerfile.
